window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Warning *18+ Romance*</b></p><p></p><p><b>The moment I fell for Ava, I knew I was in trouble. My girlfriend's sister? Off limits. Forbidden.</b> So I did the honorable thing – I broke up with Jen and buried my feelings for Ava so deep I almost convinced myself they didn't exist.</p><p></p><p><i>Almost.</i></p><p></p><p>For years, I watched Ava from the sidelines. I was her like a brother to her, protector, confidant, the shoulder she cried on when another guy broke her heart. Each time, I pieced her back together, all while my own heart silently shattered.</p><p></p><p>Then the world ended. The zombie outbreak hit, and suddenly, I wasn't me anymore. I was a monster, trapped in a haze of hunger and instinct. As my humanity slipped away, one thought remained: <i>Ava. I'd never told her. She'd never know.</i></p><p></p><p>But Ava? She's not the type to give up. While I was lost in a nightmare, she was fighting like hell to bring me back. Her voice became my lifeline, her brilliant mind the key to my salvation. Even when everyone else saw me as a lost cause, Ava saw the man beneath the monster.</p><p></p><p>Now, against all odds, I'm back. Changed, yes. Scarred, definitely. But alive, aware, and <b>done with pretending</b>. This is my second chance, and I'm not wasting it.</p><p></p><p>I don't care if the world thinks it's wrong. I don't care about the challenges we'll face. I've crawled back from the brink of oblivion for her, and I'm not hiding anymore.</p><p></p><p>Ava brought me back to life in more ways than one. Now it's my turn to show her what it means to be truly alive.</p><p></p><p>I love you, Ava. I need you. And this time, I'm not letting you go. We've already defied death – everything else is just details.</p><p></p><p><b>Are you ready for a love story that breaks all the rules? Because, sweetheart, we're just getting started.</b></p>"; 
